{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers","id":1506476,"title":"[Warning - Trigger Topics] Chris Avellone wins libel suit against accusers","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-03-26T06:23:47-07:00","id":1506476,"title":"[Warning - Trigger Topics] Chris Avellone wins libel suit against accusers","content":"<span style=\"color:#e74c3c\"><b>Due to the sensitivity of the topic, this is something that I ask everyone to be on their best behavior with for discussing. However, it is relevant due to Avellone's role in game development and the industry as a whole as well as Bloodlines 2.</b></span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.forbes.com/sites/erikkain/2023/03/25/video-game-writer-chris-avellones-accusers-issue-public-statement-retracting-accusations-of-sexual-assault/?sh=642cd7a155d8\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.forbes.com/sites/erikkai...h=642cd7a155d8</a><br /> <br /> Back in June of 2021 <a href=\"https://www.forbes.com/sites/erikkain/2021/06/26/chris-avellone-strikes-back-sexual-misconduct-allegations-karissa-barrows-kelly-bristol-dying-light-obsidian-developer/?sh=14b2c26029ff\" target=\"_blank\">I reported on video game writer Chris Avellone\u2019s libel lawsuit</a> against two women who had accused Avellone of sexual assault on Twitter. Avellone publicly denied the accusations and announced he was taking both women to court over their statements.<br /> <br /> When the initial case was dismissed by a California court on jurisdictional grounds, Avellone filed the lawsuit in Illinois (<a href=\"https://www.courtlistener.com/docket/65383230/avellone-v-barrows/\" target=\"_blank\">September, 2022</a>).<br /> <br /> Now, nearly two years later, the case has been settled. Avellone\u2019s accusers, Karissa Barrows and Kelly Bristol, have signed a joint statement retracting their previous claims and clearing Avellone of wrongdoing, stating that their original claims were misinterpreted. \u201cThe settlement agreement provides for a seven-figure payment to Mr. Avellone,\u201d Avellone\u2019s attorney confirmed to me via email. The settlement is confidential and further details were not provided.<br /> <br /> In <a href=\"https://chrisavellone.medium.com/joint-statement-from-karissa-barrows-kelly-bristol-and-chris-avellone-3b2138e5837f\" target=\"_blank\">a blog post titled</a> \u201cJoint Statement From Karissa Barrows, Kelly Bristol,and Chris Avellone\u201d Avellone writes:<br /> <br /> \u201cThe parties resolved the matter and claims were dismissed with prejudice pursuant to a confidential settlement that provides for a seven-figure payment that includes the return of the attorney fee award entered against Mr. Avellone in California.<br /> <br /> \u201cI understand that Ms. Barrows has requested to retract her comments to the media about me.\u201d <hr /><br /> I have received a copy of the below statement from Mr. Avellone\u2019s lawyers.<br /> <br /> The statement from Barrows and Bristol reads:<br /> <br /> <i>\u201cAfter engaging with Mr. Avellone, we have prepared the following statement:<br /> <br /> \u201cMr. Avellone never sexually abused either of us. We have no knowledge that he has ever sexually abused any women. We have no knowledge that Mr. Avellone has ever misused corporate funds. Anything we have previously said or written about Mr. Avellone to the contrary was not our intent. We wanted to support women in the industry. In so doing, our words have been misinterpreted to suggest specific allegations of misconduct that were neither expressed nor intended. We are passionate about the safety, security and agency of women, minorities, LGBTQIA+ persons, and every other community that has seen persecution in the video game industry. We believe Mr. Avellone shares a desire to protect and uplift those communities. We believe that he deserves a full return to the industry and support him in those endeavors.\u201d<br /> <br /> - Karissa Barrows, Kelly Rae Bristol</i><br /> <br /> Avellone\u2019s statement on the matter reads:<br /> <br /> \u201cI appreciate the willingness of Ms. Barrows and Ms. Bristol to work with us in addressing issues within the game community, and their advocacy is to be commended and supported.<br /> <br /> There are still many very real challenges that we face but am confident we can face them together.<br /> <br /> In the spirit of these goals, I would ask everyone to respect the privacy of Ms. Barrows and Ms. Bristol and use this opportunity as a means to listen to all voices in improving our culture and our communities.\u201d<br /> <br /> - Chris Avellone <hr /><br /> Barrows had previously claimed on Twitter that Avellone was \u201can abusive, abrasive, conniving sexual predator\u201d who had attempted to sexually assault her after getting her \u201cblack out drunk.\u201d Barrows <a href=\"https://kotaku.com/multiple-women-accuse-games-writer-chris-avellone-of-se-1844135498\" target=\"_blank\">told Kotaku</a> in 2020, \u201cHe\u2019s f****** disgusting, but he did not rape me. He assaulted me, 100 percent, but I stopped him.\u201d<br /> <br /> Avellone was fired from his job working on <i>Dying Light 2 </i>when the accusations came to light and has been widely blacklisted from the industry after a decades-long career working on dozens of popular video games including numerous RPGs like <i>Pillars of Eternity, Icewind Dale </i>and <i>Fallout 2.</i><br /> <br /> This is a breaking story. Stay tuned.<br /> <br /> <i>This post was updated with the exact statement from Avellone\u2019s lawyers in order to provide more detail on the payout. Further details from the confidential settlement agreement remain confidential.</i><br /> \u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T07:19:40-07:00","id":1506478,"title":"","content":"Interesting, sexual abuse accusations are notoriously hard to convinct but innocent until proven guilty is a thing. Without personal knowledge of him or his accusers I reluctantly have to presume chris' innocence.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 03-26-2023, 10:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T07:41:51-07:00","id":1506479,"title":"","content":"I agree with <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar26986_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26986\" data-vbnamecard=\"26986\">Ragged Robin</a>. I also wonder where the accusers got the money to pay Chris Avellone a seven-figure settlement.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T08:07:52-07:00","id":1506482,"title":"","content":"what a terribe thing they did to him","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 03-26-2023, 11:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T10:19:17-07:00","id":1506492,"title":"","content":"After what happened to Johnny Depp and his baseless accusations and the co creator of Rick and Morty. People are being more concerned about such charges and how the accusers seem to get off Scott free when they get caught in a lie.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T11:06:50-07:00","id":1506497,"title":"","content":"Given the fact that the amount of collateral damage from unfounded accusations has been growing since the #MeToo thing got rolling is on par with the french revolution, why are people not insisting on wrongful termination clauses in their contracts specifically to prevent dismissal until after a court verdict has been reached. I mean this has been going on long enough for the contract lawyers to get wise to this situation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/727-thoth","name":"Thoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar727_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1689"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T11:10:57-07:00","id":1506498,"title":"","content":"Rephrasing &quot;got his opponents to settle&quot; isn't the same as &quot;winning.&quot; It's just forcing them not to talk about it any more.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers?p=1506478#post1506478\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Interesting, sexual abuse accusations are notoriously hard to convinct but innocent until proven guilty is a thing. Without personal knowledge of him or his accusers I reluctantly have to presume chris' innocence.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is a defamation case, not a criminal case. The standards of evidence and what juries are allowed to draw inferences from are different.<br /> <br /> He also sued them. He accused them of lying, and rather than going to court to prove that they lied, he settled so the truth will never actually be found out by the public. We're allowed to infer whatever we want from that.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amethyst</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers?p=1506479#post1506479\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I also wonder where the accusers got the money to pay Chris Avellone a seven-figure settlement.</div> </div> </div> </div>As noted in the article, that figure includes the money awarded to them as part of a finding in their favor in California. &quot;Seven-figures&quot; sounds like a lot, but for two individuals getting private presentation in California (which Avellone was forced to pay for after the finding against him)? I'd wager that's pretty much where the majority of the money is headed. Lawyers are, definitely getting most of the money anyway.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers?p=1506482#post1506482\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">what a terribe thing they did to him</div> </div> </div> </div>This sort of cut &amp; dry interpretation of a defamation settlement only makes things worse, for example:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers?p=1506492#post1506492\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">After what happened to Johnny Depp...</div> </div> </div> </div>As a reminder, Depp and Heard were <b>both</b> found to have defamed and abused each other. Who got more money out of it is largely based on who has more money, not who is more or less morally culpable.<br /> <br /> But because the public doesn't like court cases to end with messy convoluted resolutions (which happens far more often than not), someone was declared the winner, and that was Depp, despite all of the horrible shit he admitted to doing on the stand.<br /> <br /> Justin Roiland? His case wasn't dropped because there was nothing there, just not enough there to convict them. But the media doesn't like leaving things without an &quot;ending.' so there needs to be a narrative of &quot;vindication&quot; for him even though he wasn't vindicated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T11:19:53-07:00","id":1506500,"title":"","content":"sorry if i jumped the gun,but didnt't the accusers downright stated they lied?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T11:39:11-07:00","id":1506502,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers?p=1506500#post1506500\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">sorry if i jumped the gun,but didnt't the accusers downright stated they lied?</div> </div> </div> </div>It was settled out of court, ie both parties (while being advised by their lawyers) came to an agreement to end the matter without going through a whole trial. Considering how it ended (with the statement and seven-figure-payment to Chris Avellone), it's clear who had the stronger hand in those negotiations. But there's a lot that goes into considerations like this: money, time, the invasion of privacy etc. There are lots of reasons to settle out of court before getting bogged down in a trial. But at the end of the day, it's just two parties who came to an agreement. We don't have all the facts and we don't know what these negotiations were like. So, really knowing who's right or wrong in a situation like this can only be speculative.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T11:43:36-07:00","id":1506503,"title":"","content":"oh ok,i have no knowledge of american law so i am not able to give an informed opinion","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T11:46:35-07:00","id":1506504,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers?p=1506498#post1506498\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Rephrasing &quot;got his opponents to settle&quot; isn't the same as &quot;winning.&quot; It's just forcing them not to talk about it any more.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> This is a defamation case, not a criminal case. The standards of evidence and what juries are allowed to draw inferences from are different.<br /> <br /> He also sued them. He accused them of lying, and rather than going to court to prove that they lied, he settled so the truth will never actually be found out by the public. We're allowed to infer whatever we want from that.<br /> <br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>True, have any actual changes been put against him with that in mind?<br /> <br />","