class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers?p=1506509#post1506509\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Then my initial statement stands and I have to presume chris' innocence. Since what anyone has on him is bugger all even if it does leave a slightly bad taste in the mouth.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers?p=1506519#post1506519\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not to mention that we should wait for all the story to be told before jumping the gun. Recent events have proven and even old cases like The JonBenet Ramsey case have borne out.</div> </div> </div> </div>Again though, this is ignoring a simple factual truth:<br /> <br /> Chris Avellone has waived his right to have the full story told, and instead chosen to make sure the full story is never told.<br /> <br /> You can presume what you'd like, but the evidence is that Chris chose to silence the full story instead of telling the full story. He chose a narrative that he wants, rather than the jury system to analyze everyone's statements and evidence and come to a conclusion.<br /> <br /> His confidence in his innocence wasn't enough to finish a court case he initiated.<br /> <br /> His decisions means we never get the full story. This is as much as we're ever going to know. That's why people push to settle cases: because silence is something at least one side values more than airing the truth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T17:40:08-07:00","id":1506557,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers?p=1506546#post1506546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That is a shitty thing for people to do. But children and teenagers are cruel.</div> </div> </div> </div>cheers i'll drink some soda to that","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T18:12:42-07:00","id":1506564,"title":"","content":"Avallone sounds like kind of a scummy person, cruising conventions for sex and pressuring women into having sex with him. I recall there were texts from a neighbor of his where he was trying to get her to have sex with him. Still, from what I've heard from people who have known him for a long time though, he isn't a serial assaulter, predator or rapist. But, I'm guessing that's why he'd rather not have the full story get out, because even if he didn't sexually assault anyone, he doesn't really want the public attention on the fact that that he's an absolute horndog and kind of scummy person. Getting a settlement and having his accusers retract their statements is good enough.<br /> <br /> Anyway, it's clear those allegations hurt him financially and, beyond just Avellone, ended up significantly hurting other people as well (those allegations against Avellone were likely the reason why his work and Mitsoda's work was cut out of Bloodlines 2 and the game had to be completely redone), so the monetary settlement to him seems reasonable. If nothing else, he's a pretty good writer and I hope to see more of his work in the future.<br /> <br /> And I am curious what effect, if any, this will have on Bloodlines 2 and if his work and Mitsoda's will end up being reincorporated, in some form, into the game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T18:25:12-07:00","id":1506566,"title":"","content":"I don't see how this would have impacted Mitsoda's work? According to Paradox, Avellone's work on Bloodlines had been tossed out well before the accusations were made against him. While the accusations were made right around when Mitsoda was let go, according to him, he was shocked and that it was very sudden. I can see why it looks suspect on casual glance, but the details don't add up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T18:38:45-07:00","id":1506567,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers?p=1506566#post1506566\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't see how this would have impacted Mitsoda's work? According to Paradox, Avellone's work on Bloodlines had been tossed out well before the accusations were made against him. While the accusations were made right around when Mitsoda was let go, according to him, he was shocked and that it was very sudden. I can see why it looks suspect on casual glance, but the details don't add up.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was under the impression that there was disagreement between Mitsoda and HLS over Avellone getting canned and Mitsoda ended up getting canned as a result. They obviously can't talk about what happened but the two were pretty supportive of one another over social media. Paradox only publicly noted that Avellone's work was being completely excised from the game after the allegations against him came out, and maybe without those allegations it's possible that at least some of his writing would have remained in the game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T19:14:46-07:00","id":1506574,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers?p=1506554#post1506554\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> His confidence in his innocence wasn't enough to finish a court case he initiated.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Uh, this\u2026 sounds dangerous.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T19:32:46-07:00","id":1506582,"title":"","content":"People's shitty politics out in full force tonight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27252-hades","name":"Hades","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T19:36:41-07:00","id":1506584,"title":"","content":"we musn't forget,the women told us they were lying. whatever else is under scrutiny,whateve is still udnsicovered,the fact they lied is not,the fact they for whatever reason spoke falsehoods is undeniably true","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 03-26-2023, 10:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T20:16:03-07:00","id":1506595,"title":"","content":"I'm not really willing to take a retraction of an accusation, made after settling a defamation suit out of court, at face value. It doesn't tell me the women were lying. It tells me one side had more money to throw around in a case than the other, making it financially advantageous to settle.<br /> <br /> I generally prefer to believe the women in cases involving alleged sexual misconduct, as a general rule. Nor do I have much confidence in the court system to actually see justice done.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T20:57:35-07:00","id":1506602,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers?p=1506478#post1506478\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Interesting, sexual abuse accusations are notoriously hard to convinct but innocent until proven guilty is a thing. Without personal knowledge of him or his accusers I reluctantly have to presume chris' innocence.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, his accusers have publicly retracted their statement. Which could theoretically be under financial pressure but could simply be sincere.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers?p=1506502#post1506502\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It was settled out of court, ie both parties (while being advised by their lawyers) came to an agreement to end the matter without going through a whole trial. Considering how it ended (with the statement and seven-figure-payment to Chris Avellone), it's clear who had the stronger hand in those negotiations. But there's a lot that goes into considerations like this: money, time, the invasion of privacy etc. There are lots of reasons to settle out of court before getting bogged down in a trial. But at the end of the day, it's just two parties who came to an agreement. We don't have all the facts and we don't know what these negotiations were like. So, really knowing who's right or wrong in a situation like this can only be speculative.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> <br /> I mean, that's the big thing of the article from my perspective. Not that Avellone won, it's the fact his accusers have not only retracted their statements but state they never actually accused him of being a sexual predator and don't believe he is.<br /> <br /> Which means you either believe they're lying about their retraction (perhaps for financial or legal reasons) or Avellone is actually innocent.<br /> <br /> Notably, they state they never meant for him to actually be accused of anything.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bluecho</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers?p=1506595#post1506595\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not really willing to take a retraction of an accusation, made after settling a defamation suit out of court, at face value. It doesn't tell me the women were lying. It tells me one side had more money to throw around in a case than the other, making it financially advantageous to settle.<br /> <br /> I generally prefer to believe the women in cases involving alleged sexual misconduct, as a general rule. Nor do I have much confidence in the court system to actually see justice done.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> <br /> Very possibly.<br /> <br /> On the other hand, what is the actual avenue for addressing a false accusation? 99% of all accusations of sexual misconduct are true but the unfortunate 1% do exist as DNA evidence has occasionally exonerated individuals.<br /> <br /> Like those two guys who kept trying to hire women to claim Democratic politicans attacked them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 03-27-2023, 12:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T21:05:29-07:00","id":1506604,"title":"","content":"<b><span style=\"color:#e74c3c\">Also, it shouldn't need to be said but let's not use this as an avenue to talk about Johnny Depp/Amber Heard or #MeToo. Conflation is considered thread drift and frankly tacky as well as tasteless.</span></b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T21:06:30-07:00","id":1506605,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bluecho</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers?p=1506595#post1506595\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not really willing to take a retraction of an accusation, made after settling a defamation suit out of court, at face value. It doesn't tell me the women were lying. It tells me one side had more money to throw around in a case than the other, making it financially advantageous to settle.</div> </div> </div> </div>Barrows and Bristol had to pay hundred(s) of thousands of dollars to Chris Avellone. It seems that if they had wanted to continue fighting, they had the money to do so, plus there are a lot of lawyers who are willing to accept pro bono work or at lower costs to defend women who were sexually assaulted. However, it seems like Avellone's defamation case was strong and solid enough that their lawyers urged them to simply stop fighting, give up, pay out Avellone and issue a statement that they lied rather than have the case go to trial.<br /> <br /> Libel and defamation are usually fairly hard to prove in court, because you need to provide evidence showing that the individuals intentionally and knowingly lied in order to hurt someone or their reputation. So off hand, it seems that Avellone's lawyers likely had some sort of evidence (maybe text messages or emails or recordings) demonstrating that one or both of them were lying, such that Barrows and Bristol's lawyers urged them to give up now rather than allow the case to trial where they would likely end up losing worse and even more money. <br /> <br /> It's possible that they were telling the truth before and are lying now, but it's more plausible to me that their initial statements weren't entirely truthful and, had the case gone to court, that would have come out and there was a high likelihood that they would have ended up having to pay even more in damages.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T21:24:05-07:00","id":1506607,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers?p=1506554#post1506554\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> Again though, this is ignoring a simple factual truth:<br /> <br /> Chris Avellone has waived his right to have the full story told, and instead chosen to make sure the full story is never told.<br /> <br /> You can presume what you'd like, but the evidence is that Chris chose to silence the full story instead of telling the full story. He chose a narrative that he wants, rather than the jury system to analyze everyone's statements and evidence and come to a conclusion.<br /> <br /> His confidence in his innocence wasn't enough to finish a court case he initiated.<br /> <br /> His decisions means we never get the full story. This is as much as we're ever going to know. That's why people push to settle cases: because silence is something at least one side values more than airing the truth.</div> </div> </div> </div>Their is no simple truth here because theirs barely anything at all. we have no idea of the finer details and none of the parties involved actually have an obligation to inform us and you have no evidence otherwise. You can pressume his guilt of what wasn't said and speculate on his motivations if you wish but that's a pretty weak arguement and ultimately your completly subjective stance which doesn't have anything to back it up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 03-27-2023, 01:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T21:28:31-07:00","id":1506608,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers?p=1506602#post1506602\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I mean, his accusers have publicly retracted their statement. Which could theoretically be under financial pressure but could simply be sincere.<br /> <br /> \u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty much yeah, you can speculate but truth is we don't actually know one way or the other. its a pretty messy subject. They could be innocent victims bullied into silence or they could be liars who got caught but they've retracted their stances and no further proceedings are ongoing so I don't really have any threads to pull.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 03-27-2023, 12:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T22:33:45-07:00","id":1506610,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">You can presume what you'd like, but the evidence is that Chris chose to silence the full story instead of telling the full story. He chose a narrative that he wants, rather than the jury system to analyze everyone's statements and evidence and come to a conclusion.\u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>Mind you, the story that Avellone says is, &quot;nothing happened.&quot;<br /> <br /> The thing he wanted from them was, &quot;We not only don't think anything happened. We never accused him of it happening. It was all a big misunderstanding.&quot;<br /> <br /> So not wanting anything to go beyond a retraction isn't a sign of a coverup, necessarily.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T23:14:08-07:00","id":1506611,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers?p=1506567#post1506567\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was under the impression that there was disagreement between Mitsoda and HLS over Avellone getting canned and Mitsoda ended up getting canned as a result</div> </div> </div> </div>The only person to public imply this despite admitting lacking any direct knowledge of it was Avellone himself. Mitsoda, HLS, and Paradox have never said anything remotely backing up this idea. Mitsoda was also not the only person let go at that time, including another major member of the BL2 who didn't have a long history with Avellone.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers?p=1506574#post1506574\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Uh, this\u2026 sounds dangerous.</div> </div> </div> </div>But, it isn't, because it's a civil case.<br /> <br /> It's dangerous in criminal law, where the state have the benefit of a huge disparity in power - including the power to use violence to punish people - that makes the presumption on innocence an essential part of criminal justice standards.<br /> <br /> Avellone didn't have to sue them. He decided it was in his best interest to. He didn't have to accept a settlement. He decided it was his best interest to. Legally speaking, individuals that settle cases a lot because they some find themselves in civil suits that often can in fact have that used against them. Just like juries in civil cases can use invoking 5th Amendment rights against someone in ways that wouldn't be allowed in criminal cases.<br /> <br /> It's even less dangerous on a Internet forum where we only know about any of this because he worked on a video game a lot of us like from 20 years ago, and temporarily worked on its sequel before any of this came out.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers?p=1506584#post1506584\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">we musn't forget,the women told us they were lying. whatever else is under scrutiny,whateve is still udnsicovered,the fact they lied is not,the fact they for whatever reason spoke falsehoods is undeniably true</div> </div> </div> </div>They didn't tell us they were lying. They told us that their statements had unintended negative consequences for Avellone. Their official statements contain no admission of false statements.<br /> \u200b<br /> This is not admitting to lying: &quot;<i>Anything we have previously said or written about Mr. Avellone to the contrary was not our intent. We wanted to support women in the industry. In so doing, our words have been misinterpreted to suggest specific allegations of misconduct that were neither expressed nor intended.</i>\u200b&quot;<br /> <br /> Now, in a sane and logical world, they'd have to be lying, but US civil law doesn't operate that way. US civil law is a place where you can win a case by saying you absolutely lied, but as a known liar nobody would ever believe you, so anything you said couldn't be defamatory because no right-minded person would actually believe it to have damaged their opinion of someone else.<br /> <br /> These sorts of boiler plate &quot;we concede the case without actually admitting any wrong doing&quot; responses are the norm, because as I said before, these settlements are about silencing the truth, not allowing the truth to get out.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers?p=1506605#post1506605\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Barrows and Bristol had to pay hundred(s) of thousands of dollars to Chris Avellone. It seems that if they had wanted to continue fighting, they had the money to do so, plus there are a lot of lawyers who are willing to accept pro bono work or at lower costs to defend women who were sexually assaulted.</div> </div> </div> </div>Again, as noted, the lawyer fees Avellone was ordered to pay for Barrows and Bristol in California for part of this case that he lost was officially stated to be part of the payment the settlement includes (and the only explicit monetary damage Avellone was recovering in the settlement). That does not mean they had enough wealth to continue the case indefinitely.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers?p=1506607#post1506607\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Their is no simple truth here because theirs barely anything at all.</div> </div> </div> </div>A lack of a simple conclusion does not mean there's a lack of simple truths in the story.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> we have no idea of the finer details and none of the parties involved actually have an obligation to inform us. </div> </div> </div>One side of the issue has used a legal procedure to ban the other side from informing us even if they wanted to. That's one of those actual simple facts here. The settlement didn't have to include an NDA, but it does.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers?p=1506610#post1506610\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The thing he wanted from them was, &quot;We not only don't think anything happened. We never accused him of it happening. It was all a big misunderstanding.&quot;<br /> <br /> So not wanting anything to go beyond a retraction isn't a sign of a coverup, necessarily.</div> </div> </div> </div>If this was true, his lawyers are guilty of misconduct for using a defamation suit to force an outcome instead of suing over what their client actually believed. Of course this happens all the time in defamation law despite attempts to stop it, but that's why at least a few of us here don't consider this outcome particularly exculpatory. He could have sued over intentional infliction of emotional distress (which doesn't put the truth at issue at all, like defamation cases) over the allegations being made when they were made and how they were made... but almost nobody gets sued over that because it comes with very low damages compared to defamation.<br /> <br /> Basically, it's the civil version of purposefully overcharging a case to try to force a guilty plea on a lesser charge when the lesser charge should have been the charge in the first place. It's something that shouldn't happen, but our legal system encourages far more than it works to end.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T23:33:13-07:00","id":1506612,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers?p=1506611#post1506611\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A lack of a simple conclusion does not mean there's a lack of simple truths in the story.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> One side of the issue has used a legal procedure to ban the other side from informing us even if they wanted to. That's one of those actual simple facts here. The settlement didn't have to include an NDA, but it does.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> .</div> </div> </div> </div>Correct. For example we have absolutely no proof chris is guilty of anything and a retraction of a previous accusation.<br /> <br /> On the other we gave a retraction of a previous statement and anything beyond that is ultimatly speculation on our part.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-27T01:20:59-07:00","id":1506613,"title":"","content":"That includes presuming innocence though. As there's no default presumption of innocence (in fact the presumption on innocence is on the two women as the one's being sued), and no facts to determine certainty, saying that you (specific or general) &quot;have&quot; to presume he's innocent is just a form of justifying one way of speculating on the matter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-27T03:13:32-07:00","id":1506617,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers?p=1506613#post1506613\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That includes presuming innocence though. As there's no default presumption of innocence (in fact the presumption on innocence is on the two women as the one's being sued), and no facts to determine certainty, saying that you (specific or general) &quot;have&quot; to presume he's innocent is just a form of justifying one way of speculating on the matter.</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually in terms of conversation their is a presumption of innocence I can't pressume guilt especially if the statement is withdrawn. I havnt really speculated one way ot another on the topic to the point I've been deliberately not writting obvious counter arguements to some of your points since it'd ultimately be speculation. <br /> <br /> Since the statement was retractretracted their isn't a need to presume innocence (or guilt) on the two women's since ultimately theirs nothing to presume about. I could theoretically speculate but I'm disinclined to do so. Especially on such a heated subject","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 03-27-2023, 06:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-27T03:38:08-07:00","id":1506618,"title":"","content":"But you're inherently making presumptions about their innocence or guilt if you make a presumption about him being innocent.<br /> <br /> Saying that your presume Avellone is truthful in claiming they lied about him in a defamatory fashion means you presume that they're guilt. You can't coherently have it both ways were you presume he's innocent and make no presumptions about their allegations. If you feel you have to presume that Chris is innocent (even though this is a civil defamation case he filed and innocence isn't really the standard anyway), then you logically have to be speculating about his accusers. You can't really have it both ways here.<br /> <br /> Presuming innocence on one said, and claiming you're making no speculative statements is not a sound argument.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-27T06:50:33-07:00","id":1506621,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers?p=1506618#post1506618\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But you're inherently making presumptions about their innocence or guilt if you make a presumption about him being innocent.<br /> <br /> Saying that your presume Avellone is truthful in claiming they lied about him in a defamatory fashion means you presume that they're guilt. You can't coherently have it both ways were you presume he's innocent and make no presumptions about their allegations. If you feel you have to presume that Chris is innocent (even though this is a civil defamation case he filed and innocence isn't really the standard anyway), then you logically have to be speculating about his accusers. You can't really have it both ways here.<br /> <br /> Presuming innocence on one said, and claiming you're making no speculative statements is not a sound argument.</div> </div> </div> </div>Am I? Since the statement is retracted theirs nothing for me to comment on in terms of innocence or guilt. At worst you can try to argue you're personally dissatisfied with the resolution which doesn't mean a great deal.<br /> <br /> Actually I can, since theirs no standing statement and an outright retraction I don't have to speculate. I'm barely presuming chris' innocence because currently he isn't accused of anything to be innocent off at worst you can say he was accused of something but currently isn't.<br /> <br /> Agreed because its not an arguement, its a statement. Chris isnt currently accused of anything-the accusation was retracted so I don't have to speculate on anything and am deliberately not doing so.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-27T07:19:12-07:00","id":1506622,"title":"","content":"Truth is an affirmative defense to defamation in most states, not an element that the plaintiff has to prove. If you sue someone in defamation, all you have to prove is that the defendant made the statement and that the statement damaged your reputation. It\u2019s up to the defendant to prove that the statement is true; you are not required to prove that the defendant lied.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-27T08:27:09-07:00","id":1506623,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amethyst</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506476-warning-trigger-topics-chris-avellone-wins-libel-suit-against-accusers?p=1506622#post1506622\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Truth is an affirmative defense to defamation in most states, not an element that the plaintiff has to prove. If you sue someone in defamation, all you have to prove is that the defendant made the statement and that the statement damaged your reputation. It\u2019s up to the defendant to prove that the statement is true; you are not required to prove that the defendant lied.</div> </div> </div> </div>While true, the fact that the most common defense against defamation is that the accusation is true and the subject have made their retraction is exactly also what would have been done should the subject have lied.<br /> <br /> Which is not saying that they did (they deny they did--but also deny they accused Chris Avelone of sexual assault).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.